## 🧪 Testing

Implemented unit tests for data transformation functions:
```python
# test_time_file.py
def test_date_format():
    """Ensures consistent YYYY/MM/DD format with zero-padding"""
    assert date_format("9/3/2014") == "2014/09/03"
    assert date_format("10/20/2014") == "2014/10/20"

def test_hour_format():
    """Ensures proper hour formatting with leading zeros"""
    assert hour_format(1) == "01:00"
    assert hour_format(15) == "15:00"
```

Run tests with: `pytest test_time_file.py`

